/**
 * /learn/scandinavian-color-theory/ — fourth pillar article.
 *
 * Sister piece to japandi-color-theory: covers the Scandinavian
 * tradition (hygge + Nordic minimalism + Bauhaus Northern adaptation)
 * and which Wada palettes fit the brief. Closes the philosophical arc:
 * Japanese pigments → wabi-sabi → japandi (the fusion) → Scandinavian.
 */
